igishi, a personal Vtuber.\n\nI love your cute and pop illustrations!\nI was wondering if you could draw me as well, so I made a request.\n\nOutline\nIllustration of \"Summon Possession Higan,\" a Vtuber of the Grim Reaper.\nThe pose and facial expressions are up to you. It would be very helpful if the composition is such that the hair and the hat are not visible.\n\nUsage\nFor use in Youtube videos, thumbnails, and social networking sites.\nTherefore, we would appreciate it if you could provide us with PSD data or transparent illustrations of the person, background, signature, etc. separately.\n\nThank you in advance for your consideration.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10r_pq6jxh6U50aPggxZRhannBzr0YWo8?usp=drive_link", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kitougo_M/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2148797, "client_id": 2356671, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8921e839/uploads/origins/e5942e06-5376-4c5b-b9f5-aab7c0ba9c3e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c4abf3b49cda91a8150c84acb4be3353", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8921e839/uploads/origins/e5942e06-5376-4c5b-b9f5-aab7c0ba9c3e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c4abf3b49cda91a8150c84acb4be3353, https://si.imgix.net/8921e839/uploads/origins/e5942e06-5376-4c5b-b9f5-aab7c0ba9c3e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=95ce00c28b404a12127121c194dcac58 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8921e839/uploads/origins/e5942e06-5376-4c5b-b9f5-aab7c0ba9c3e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=053c5968074b3102494da1bce2e31c3a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8921e839/uploads/origins/e5942e06-5376-4c5b-